# Root-level ignore rules for the Elshorok ERP workspace.
#
# PURPOSE (C0.5-B / blocker B1): the git root sits ABOVE shorok-erp-app, and
# shorok-erp-app/.gitignore only applies inside that subdirectory. Without these
# rules a single `git add -A` from the root would stage production database
# dumps, customer CSV extracts and private cutover source data.
#
# Nothing here deletes or moves existing files; it only stops them being staged.

# ── OS / editor noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ── Build / tool caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.turbo/
node_modules/

# ── Database dumps & backups (NEVER commit — real financial data + password
#    hashes). The negation keeps Prisma migrations committable: they are
#    tracked *.sql files and new ones MUST still be stageable.
*.sql
*.dump
*.backup
*.bak
!shorok-erp-app/apps/api/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql
prod-backup-*.sql
dev-backup-*.sql
local-backup-*.sql
shorok-erp-app/dev-backup-*.sql

# ── Spreadsheets / documents used as private data sources ──────────────────
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf

# ── Private cutover / import source data and audit output ──────────────────
_shorok_private_import_*/
**/audit-output/
xcl_data_to_import/

# ── Local data extracts & inspection artifacts ─────────────────────────────
price-498-audit-*.csv
shorok-erp-app/apps/api/inspect-results.txt

# ── Quarantined one-off import scripts (NOT part of the application) ───────
# seed-excel.ts embeds client-identifiable strings and its header instructs
# `railway run` (i.e. execute against PRODUCTION); it also writes directly via
# Prisma, bypassing the posting/inventory engines. inspect-excel.ts hard-codes a
# local absolute path. Both are ignored so they can never be staged by accident.
# They remain on disk untouched and must be relocated to private storage in a
# separate, explicitly approved phase (see C0 audit blocker C2).
shorok-erp-app/apps/api/prisma/seed-excel.ts
shorok-erp-app/apps/api/inspect-excel.ts

# One-time historical importer, kept locally as a reference and never part of
# the deployed tree. It is ignored so a broad `git add` cannot sweep it into a
# commit or a deployment archive again.
shorok-erp-app/apps/api/prisma/seed-legacy.ts
